graph LR
    TAI["trustyai-service<br/>explainability-service"]

    %% Bundled libraries
    TAI -->|algorithms + metrics| Core["explainability-core"]
    TAI -->|prediction clients| Conn["explainability-connectors"]
    Arrow["explainability-arrow"] -.->|Python interop| Core

    %% External runtime dependencies
    TAI -->|runtime| Quarkus["Quarkus 3.20.6.2"]
    TAI -->|HTTP server| Vertx["Vert.x 4.5.32 / Netty 4.1.125"]
    Conn -->|gRPC client| GRPC["gRPC Java 1.75.0<br/>protobuf 3.25.5"]
    Core -->|counterfactual search| Opta["OptaPlanner 8.30.0"]
    TAI -->|base image| UBI["ubi9/openjdk-17-runtime<br/>digest-pinned"]
    TAI -.->|optional storage| MinIOLib["quarkus-minio 3.8.6"]
    TAI -.->|optional storage| JDBC["JDBC: MariaDB / MySQL / H2"]

    %% Internal RHOAI dependencies
    Operator["trustyai-service-operator"] -->|deploys, sidecars, TLS, DB| TAI
    ModelMesh["ModelMesh Serving"] -->|payload push| TAI
    KServe["KServe"] -->|CloudEvents logger| TAI
    TAI -.->|"explainer gRPC (ODH only)"| KServe
    Prom["Prometheus / UWM"] -->|scrape /q/metrics| TAI
    Dashboard["RHOAI Dashboard"] -->|metric config| TAI
    PySvc["trustyai-service Python"] -.->|successor in 3.7| TAI

    %% External services
    TAI -.->|JDBC| DB["MariaDB / MySQL"]
    TAI -.->|S3 API| MinIO["MinIO / S3"]
    TAI -->|PVC CSV| PVC["PersistentVolume"]
    TAI -.->|legacy init container| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]

